 "id": 1342647,
 "titulo": "February Update Details (Updated)",
 "fecha": 1550559941189,
 "modificada": 1732796583851,
 "url": "https://forum.netmarble.com/futurefight_en/view/2196/1342647",
 "html": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/01/081112/eeeuPdate.jpg\" style=\"font-size: 11px;\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">Greetings, Agents!</span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">CM Fragment here again, with the update details for February Update!</span></span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Did everyone enjoy our January update?</span></span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Our February update will feature content inspired by Marvel’s </span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><em>Captain Marvel</em></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">, in theaters March 8.</span></span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">To kick things off, </span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>3 new characters</strong></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"> have been added to the game.</span></span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Minn-Erva</strong></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"> and </span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Korath</strong></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"> of the elite Kree Starforce join the battle! The Director of S.H.I.E.L.D. and the founder of the Avengers, </span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Nick Fury, </strong></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">also makes his introduction</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>!</strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">4 new uniforms have been added to the game! </span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Captain Marvel, Ronan, Minn-Erva, and Nick Fury</strong></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"> will get uniforms based on MARVEL’s </span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><em>Captain Marvel</em></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">!</span></span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>5 more characters</strong></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"> can now realize their inner </span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Potential</strong></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">!</span></span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">With Captain Marvel’s awakening, she receives her </span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Tier-3</strong></span></span> <span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>upgrade</strong></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">! With this, you can tap into her full potential as one of the universe’s most powerful heroes!</span></span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">We’ve added a new MARVEL’s </span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><em><strong>Captain Marvel</strong></em></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong> themed Legendary Battle</strong></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"> and </span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Uniform Collection.</strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">An all-new equipment has been added to assist our characters! </span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>A new C.T.P.</strong></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"> has been added.</span></span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">A new </span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Special Mission Pack </strong></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">has been added to make Special Missions even more enjoyable!</span></span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Other game improvements</strong></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">, enhancements and </span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>other game fixes</strong></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"> are also in this update.</span></span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"color: #ff9900;\">▣ </span><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>3 New Characters Added!</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">2 fearless Kree heroes, </span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Minn-Erva and Korath</strong></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">, along with </span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Nick Fury,</strong></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"> who teams up with Captain Marvel, have arrived in MARVEL Future Fight!</span></span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/02/191408/min.png\"></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/02/191408/kor.png\"></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/02/191408/nic.png\"></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">* The Skill descriptions shown above are at Skill Level 1.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: 100%;\"><span style=\"color: #ff9900;\">▣ </span><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>4 New Uniforms Added!</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><br>\n<span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">The war between the Kree and the Skrulls has begun on Earth. </span></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">4 characters will demonstrate their power using their new uniforms for their own goals.</span></span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">New uniforms for </span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Captain Marvel / Ronan / Minn-Erva / Nick Fury </strong></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">have been added.</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/02/191408/uni.png\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: 100%;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">* The Skill descriptions shown above are at Skill Level 1.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">* 4 new uniforms will be on sale during the event period. You can check them out on the Marvel Universe menu and by going to the Uniform Room.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"color: #ff9900;\">▣ <span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Arial Unicode MS', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>5 </strong></span></span></span></span><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>More Characters Can Now Realize Their Potential</strong></span></span></span><br>\n<br>\n<span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Within the February update, you can now realize the Potential of the following characters:&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Captain Marvel, Ronan, Minn-Erva, Nick Fury, and Korath.</strong></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">You can now level them up to level 70.</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: 100%;\"><span style=\"color: #ff9900;\">▣ <span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>New Tier-3 Upgrade</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Captain Marvel’s MCU appearance has given her new powers as one of MCU’s best heroes.<br>\nCheck below to see her new Ultimate Skill!</span></span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://media.giphy.com/media/dIUDHzyirFt32TSdVd/giphy.gif\"></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">* This picture is showcasing Captain Marvel’s Radiant Form skill, along with activating her Ultimate Skill while she is wearing her MARVEL’s </span><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><em>Captain Marvel</em></span><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"> Uniform.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c3.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/02/191607/cap.png\"></span></span></span><br>\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: 100%;\"><span style=\"color: #ff9900;\">▣ </span><span style=\"color: #ff9900;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>New Legendary Battle: Captain Marvel</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: 100%;\"><br>\n<span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">You’ll be able to see recreated in-game scenes from the movie!</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: 100%;\"><br>\n<span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">A </span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Captain Marvel themed Legendary Battle</strong></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"> has been added in-game. </span></span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">This Legendary Battle has three missions, [Secret Agendas], [Colonel Fury], and [Final Judgement].</span></span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><br>\n<span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">In each stage, you can only use a specific character.</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"> You also get better rewards depending on the level, rank and mastery of your character, along with the rank of the uniform required.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/02/191408/q1.2.png\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">If you don’t have a 6★ Captain Marvel yet, you can get a 6★ Captain Marvel by playing this mode!&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Arial Unicode MS', serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/02/191408/q2.png\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #ff0000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">* You can get a 6★ Nick Fury (No Mastery) + 2,000,000 Gold by purchasing it for 2,500 Crystals through this Legendary Battle's Special Offers. [Added 2/19 1:19 AM (PST) | 2/19 9:19 AM (UTC+0)</span></span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana, serif;\">The Legendary Battle: Captain Marvel can be upgraded to Extreme Mode.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">This is a higher difficulty compared to Normal Mode, but you get more rewards by playing Extreme Mode!<br>\nIf you clear the stages in Extreme Mode by fulfilling the requirements, you can get various items and&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>a C.T.P. of Regeneration!</strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/02/191408/q3.png\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: 100%;\"><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">[5/8 10:31 a.m. (UTC+0) / 5/8 3:31 a.m. (PDT) added]<br>\n- Legendary Battle Extreme Mode will unlock immediately upon purchase and cannot be refunded.<br>\n- Legendary Battle Extreme Mode can be used continuously after purchase.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: 100%;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: 100%;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: 100%;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: 100%;\"><span style=\"color: #ff9900;\">▣ </span><span style=\"color: #ff9900;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>New Uniform Collection Added</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">An all-new Uniform Collection theme featuring Captain Marvel has been added! If you fulfill a specific criteria, you can register the uniforms and complete the collection.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/02/191408/q4.png\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"color: #4a86e8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>- Try completing the collection within a time </strong></span></span></span><span style=\"color: #3c78d8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>period </strong></span></span></span><span style=\"color: #4a86e8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>and get a bonus reward!</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"color: #ff9900;\">▣ <span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>New C.T.P. has been added!</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">All-new Special Equipment to help strengthen your characters!</span></span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/02/191408/ct3.png\"></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Two new C.T.P.&nbsp;are now available in-game. They are the C.T.P. of </span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Rage</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">, and Regeneration.</span></span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">You can get the C.T.P. of Regeneration as a reward by fulfilling the conditions stated in Legendary Battle: Captain Marvel Extreme Difficulty. You can also get the&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">C.T.P. of&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Rage and&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif; font-size: 16px;\">C.T.P. of Regeneration in the Shop and etc.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">[Added 2/19 1:19 AM (PST) | 2/19 9:19 AM (UTC+0)]</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">You can get these items by purchasing Custom Gear chests in our Store, and by playing Legendary Battle: Captain Marvel Extreme as a reward.<br>\nC.T.P. has better overall performance compared to normal Custom Gears. If you attempt to change the option of a C.T.P., only the numerical values will change, and the overall effect of the item will not change.</span></span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><br>\n<span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Give your characters a boost by equipping them one of these!</span></span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1551147559983\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/f05e2d22ce4b4e67be28b9cb3332d554_1551147559983_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">* The C.T.P. options shown above are the maximum options available.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"color: #ff9900;\">▣ </span><span style=\"color: #ff9900;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>New Special Mission Quest Pack added!</strong></span></span></span><br>\n<br>\n<span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Enjoy Special Missions with a new twist as we’ve added a Quest Pack!<br>\nYou can get various rewards and characters after you clear the new Quest Pack! The new Quest Pack: Realm of Kings has 32 tasks you need to clear.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/02/191451/sq1.png\"></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"color: #4a86e8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>- The rewards you can get on this Quest Pack are Premium Hero Chests, Extreme Obelisks and a variety of rank up materials!</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Once all of the tasks are completed, you get a C.T.P. of Authority as a completion reward!</span></span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\">&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/02/191451/sq2.png\" style=\"font-size: 11px;\"></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"color: #ff9900;\">▣ </span><span style=\"color: #ff9900;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Other Game Improvements</strong></span></span></span><br>\n<br>\n<span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>1. Batch Uru amplification has been improved so that you can now select multiple numbers of Urus for amplification.</strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/02/191439/og1.png\"></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>2. The Achievement Chest that you can obtain by increasing your Achievement Score in [Challenges] tab has been improved. You can now see the contents of the chest.</strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/02/191439/og2.png\"></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><strong style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">3. Auto-Repeat related improvements have been added.&nbsp;</strong></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>① If you’ve used up all of your Boost Points after enabling Auto Repeat, the notification below will appear.&nbsp;</strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/02/191451/og3.png\"></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\">&nbsp;② <span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>You can now set an option where once the Auto-Repeat function has ended, the game notifies you by vibrating.</strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/02/191451/og4.1.png\"></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"color: #4a86e8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>- You can turn on/off the Auto-Repeat related options by going to the [Settings] &gt; [Option] </strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><br>\n<span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>4. You can now sort characters by their Side or Gender within the [Marvel Universe] tab.&nbsp;</strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/02/191457/og5.png\"></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"color: #4a86e8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>- Even if you don’t own the character, you can now filter and check their information with ease using this feature!</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/02/191501/og6.png\"></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>5. Obtaining Epic Quest Collection Item Notification has been improved.</strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/02/191457/og7.png\"></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"color: #4a86e8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>- A number is displayed per each item in the collection.</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/02/191457/og8.png\"></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"color: #4a86e8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>- Upon obtaining a Collection item, the item icon will appear with a Collection number displayed on the result screen. </strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"color: #4a86e8;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2019/02/191457/og9.png\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"color: #4a86e8;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\"><strong>- </strong></span></span><span style=\"color: #4a86e8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>You will now receive a notification once you are able to collect all of the required items to complete a Collection!</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: 100%; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #ff9900;\">▣ <span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Other Game Fixes</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: 100%;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">1. Fixed an issue regarding uniform effects where upon activation of an effect, the </span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: 100%;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">uniform icon is still in pink.</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: 100%;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">2. Fixed an issue related to Victorious where her “Cosmic Javelin” skill’s ATK buff is</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: 100%;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">now proportional to her HP.</span></span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">3. Victorious’s “Impending Victory” skill has been improved, it now applies buff effects.<br>\n<br>\nThank you. </span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: 100%; text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\"><span style=\"color: #4a86e8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://sgimage.netmarble.com/images/puble/community/GAME/futurefight_en/2196/2018/11/27/1543305634499.jpg\"></p>\n"
}